7:00","id":1071982,"title":"","content":"Is there any news about it? :&gt;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1djeav1YTEwQq1fkDtWEKh7PPVFmzj3y-\" target=\"_blank\">The Repository</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13158-sir-bardiel","name":"Sir Bardiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13158_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T08:14:16-07:00","id":1088295,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately no.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11801-timil","name":"Timil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T11:36:28-07:00","id":1246712,"title":"","content":"I come seeking news on this front.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24541-familiar","name":"Familiar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T20:08:12-08:00","id":1281612,"title":"","content":"Hi all!<br /> <br /> I'm planning a Mage the Awakening 2.0 game and decided to put together my own DM Screen. As I have my 1E screen, which I suggest you get, I'm going to make a 4 page screen and stick the pages in. I just got my Changeling 2E screen in the mail so I borrowed from its layout to create this: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1HX2yqPBhIG4bAiKMjrnfBQmUZkdjYt8VyxVB5CBMwAo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/presentation...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> Hey all! I couldn't find a Mage: the Awakening 2E screen even fan generated so I decided to make my own. You can find that <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1HX2yqPBhIG4bAiKMjrnfBQmUZkdjYt8VyxVB5CBMwAo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: I did duplicate the Combat Summary Chart from Changeling's 2E screen. It seemed quite useful. I changed up the coloring. Hopefully this won't irk anyone too badly since you can't buy a Mage 2E screen.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> It's a work in progress so I might tweak it further. I hope this helps someone!<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5057,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5057-silentinfinity","user":"silentinfinity","date":".  EDIT note 01-18-2019, 11:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5057-silentinfinity","name":"silentinfinity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5057_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-20T08:51:32-08:00","id":1281782,"title":"","content":"This looks really good. Any thoughts on possibly making the screen in landscape mode? I know that will make the combat summary chart a nightmare to format though... <br /> Either way, appreciate the effort!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11055-kaltharion","name":"Kaltharion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-20T11:17:06-08:00","id":1281792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kaltharion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1040603-mage-2nd-storyteller-s-screen?p=1281782#post1281782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This looks really good. Any thoughts on possibly making the screen in landscape mode? I know that will make the combat summary chart a nightmare to format though...<br /> Either way, appreciate the effort!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hey, thank you very much! Yeah I certainly can look at landscape! I made it portrait mode to fit my Mage 1E screen but I can do something landscape. I do recommend/suggest the 1E screen. It looks pretty cool on the players' side. However, I'm totally up for trying. I'll post up when I do that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5057-silentinfinity","name":"silentinfinity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5057_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-20T11:41:50-08:00","id":1281796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kaltharion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1040603-mage-2nd-storyteller-s-screen?p=1281782#post1281782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This looks really good. Any thoughts on possibly making the screen in landscape mode? I know that will make the combat summary chart a nightmare to format though...<br /> Either way, appreciate the effort!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/16_1kGLazVyP8sKlyG8NedsMHLoj5Z5de1DA1sShU4p4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Here's a not so good looking landscape version to start with</a>. Yeah that combat summary chart will be hard to do. Harder to read in this format considering it's a longer list. Will need to modify font sizes and such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5057-silentinfinity","name":"silentinfinity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5057_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}